<title>NETHERLANDS: Stad R'dam shareholders approve new name.</title>
<headline>Stad R'dam shareholders approve new name.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insurance firm Stad Rotterdam said on Thursday its shareholders had approved the formation of a new holding company called ASR Verzekeringsgroep.</p>
<p>The move follows Stad Rotterdam's merger with unlisted insurer De Amersfoortse, orginally announced in April.</p>
<p>Stad Rotterdam shares will start trading under the new name of ASR Verzekeringsgroep on July 4, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
